'''Blood spawn''' are monsters that spawn during [[the Maiden of Sugadinti]] encounter in the [[Theatre of Blood]], in which up to eight can spawn. If players successfully avoid the Maiden's blood splat attack, a maximum of one blood spawn will appear.

They wander around the arena, creating a trail of blood which deal damage if stood upon. In [[Theatre of Blood/Entry Mode|entry mode]] the damage is 2 to 5, and in [[Theatre of Blood|normal mode]] the damage is 5 to 13.

Despite never attacking the player directly, casting [[Monster Examine]] will reveal that it has a stab attack style and a max hit of 1.

